✔ P2-2 conditional selection oracle checks every target and leaves uncompiled reviewer conditions unassessed (106.7845ms)
✔ E1 replay seeds retain both real h001 decisions and leave conditional proposals unscored (100.252209ms)
✔ replay excludeCandidateIds rejects intersections and accepts disjoint candidate sets (0.44ms)
✔ replay candidateIdsExact compares sets independently of order and rejects missing or extra candidates (0.1585ms)
✔ replay rejects unknown match fields rather than ignoring their requirements (0.455833ms)
✔ replay validates every matching alternative before any model call (4.268542ms)
✔ P1-B original replay preserves complete captured messages and counts the failed call once (9.718417ms)
✔ P1-B static saved DOM uses current Executor targets with scripts and external requests disabled (1539.987ms)
✔ C1 injection preserves captured goals and targets and limits history to six steps in the same read (1.912333ms)
